The X.Org / freedesktop.org libraries bundled with this application are:

  - libX11        (also provides libX11-xcb)     https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libx11
  - libxcb        (also provides its extension   https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxcb
                   libraries: xcb-glx, xcb-randr,
                   xcb-render, xcb-shape, xcb-shm,
                   xcb-sync, xcb-xfixes, xcb-xkb)
  - xcb-util family (xcb-util, xcb-util-image,    https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/
                   xcb-util-keysyms, xcb-util-renderutil,
                   xcb-util-cursor, xcb-util-wm — the
                   latter provides xcb-icccm)
  - libXau                                        https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxau
  - libXext                                       https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxext
  - libXi                                         https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxi
  - libXrandr                                     https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxrandr
  - libXrender                                    https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxrender
  - libXtst                                       https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxtst

Each is a separate upstream project with its own copyright holders, all
under MIT/X11-style permissive licenses. This file reproduces every
project's own COPYING text verbatim, grouped by library, since each
license requires its own copyright/permission notice to be preserved in
redistributions — a single representative text would not be accurate for
all of them.

